      "value": "Editing on the website is the best answer (See WubTheCaptain's response if you somehow haven't already), but I just want to point out that even in the modern SDK (like last X years) you don't need to fully reupload an avatar to change a thumbnail. Just go to the SDK panel, change the image and then hit save changes.",
